# One centre press for the swing start, then the power press held for 900 ms
# on the TX: it must count once, so the meter runs back past the snap line
# and the shot is a mis-hit (no third press). Start it on the tee view.
0 key-down center
60 key-up center
800 key-down center
1000 snapshot "{out}/h-held-1000.png"
1300 snapshot "{out}/h-held-1300.png"
1600 snapshot "{out}/h-held-1600.png"
1700 key-up center
1750 snapshot "{out}/h-after-1750.png"
2000 snapshot "{out}/h-after-2000.png"
